===Etymology===
''ig-'' (from ''[[ignorant]]'') + ''[[gnostic]]'' + ''-[[ism]]''. Coined by [[w:Rabbi Sherwin Wine|Rabbi Sherwin Wine]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# Belief that views regarding the existence or non-existence of deities all assume too much, especially because there is not only one universal definition of the word "God"; also called "theological noncognitivism".

